sequenceDiagram
    participant E as lyrion (Emacs)
    participant L as LMS
    participant S as squeezelite
    participant R as Radio Paradise

    E->>L: list the channels, then the chosen one's streams (CLI, 9090)
    E->>L: play the channel's FLAC stream (CLI, 9090)
    loop each song, a FLAC block of its own
        L->>S: start streaming (SlimProto, 3483)
        S->>L: request the audio (HTTP, 9000)
        L->>R: fetch the song's block (HTTPS)
        R-->>L: FLAC
        L-->>S: audio, relayed
        L-->>E: status: the song's title and cover (CLI, 9090)
        E->>L: request the cover (HTTP, 9000, image proxy)
        L->>R: fetch the cover (HTTP)
        R-->>L: image
        L-->>E: cover image
    end
    Note over E,R: Skipping a song stops its block and opens the next.
